<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-08-14T13:03:21+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Fri, 14 Aug 2026 13:03:21 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Morocco is testing a 'sponge' pavement that stays 16°F cooler by itself, aims at replacing black asphalt]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133230174.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Morocco is pioneering a novel sponge pavement designed to enhance water management and mitigate heat effects. Unlike conventional black asphalt, this innovative surface enables water to seep through, promoting natural cooling through evaporation when moisture exists. This initiative aims to bolster urban climate resilience and elevate the comfort of residents, with pilot projects underway in Marrakech and Agadir as part of a larger sustainable city initiative.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/morocco-is-testing-a-sponge-pavement-to-replace-black-asphalt-on-roads-in-marrakech-and-agadir-can-run-up-to-16f-cooler-by-itself/articleshow/133230174.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/morocco-is-testing-a-sponge-pavement-to-replace-black-asphalt-on-roads-in-marrakech-and-agadir-can-run-up-to-16f-cooler-by-itself/articleshow/133230174.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T13:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133230348,imgsize-173352.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ohio family restores 60 acres of abandoned mine land with native trees]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133230415.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2021-an-ohio-family-set-out-to-restore-60-acres-of-abandoned-mine-land-five-years-later-native-trees-are-bringing-it-back-to-life/articleshow/133230415.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2021-an-ohio-family-set-out-to-restore-60-acres-of-abandoned-mine-land-five-years-later-native-trees-are-bringing-it-back-to-life/articleshow/133230415.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T13:01:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133230532,imgsize-385223.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Iowa man faces 124 charges after alleged capture of rare Alabama turtle]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133231947.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/iowa-man-faces-124-charges-after-allegedly-capturi